{"closed":[{"id":"yes-no","pattern":"\\byes\\s*(?:or|/|-)\\s*no\\b|\\bno\\s+or\\s+yes\\b|\\btrue\\s+or\\s+false\\b|\\bor\\s+not(?=[\\s?.!…]*$)","note":"A yes or no leaves most of the 78 cards with nothing useful to say. An open “What…” or “How…” lets any card speak.","example":{"from":"Yes or no: should I take the offer?","to":"What do I need to understand before I answer the offer?"}},{"id":"when","pattern":"\\bwhen\\s+(?:will|would|shall|should|can|could|might|may)\\b(?!\\s+you\\b)|\\bwhen[’']ll\\b|\\bwhen\\s+(?:is|am|are)\\s+(?:it|this|that|i|we|he|she|they|things)\\s+(?:ever\\s+)?(?:going\\s+to|gonna)\\b|\\bwhen\\s+(?:is|[’']s)\\s+(?:the\\s+)?(?:right|best|good)\\s+(?:time|moment)\\b|\\bhow\\s+soon\\b|\\bhow\\s+long\\s+(?:until|till|before|will|must\\s+i\\s+wait|do\\s+i\\s+(?:have\\s+to\\s+)?wait)\\b|\\bby\\s+when\\b|\\b(?:what|which)\\s+(?:date|day|month|year|season)\\s+(?:will|would|should|is|does)\\b|\\bany\\s+time\\s+soon\\b","note":"Timing questions ask the cards for a date they cannot give. Asking what would help now gives every card something to offer.","example":{"from":"When will I meet someone?","to":"What would help me be open to connection right now?"}},{"id":"what-will-happen","pattern":"\\bwhat(?:\\s+will|\\s+would|\\s+is\\s+going\\s+to|\\s+is\\s+gonna|[’']s\\s+going\\s+to|[’']s\\s+gonna|[’']ll)\\s+happen\\b|\\bwhat\\s+(?:awaits|lies\\s+ahead|is\\s+(?:ahead|in\\s+store|coming)|the\\s+future\\s+(?:holds|brings))\\b|\\bwhat[’']s\\s+(?:ahead|in\\s+store|coming|next\\s+for)\\b|\\bwhat\\s+(?:does\\s+)?(?:my|our|the)\\s+future\\s+(?:holds?|looks?\\s+like|brings?)\\b|\\bhow\\s+(?:will|would)\\s+(?:it|this|that|things|everything|we|they)\\s+(?:all\\s+)?(?:end|turn\\s+out|go|play\\s+out|work\\s+out)\\b|\\bhow\\s+(?:is|[’']s)\\s+(?:it|this|that|everything)\\s+(?:going\\s+to|gonna)\\s+(?:end|turn\\s+out|go|play\\s+out)\\b","note":"This asks the cards to forecast. Asking what you want, and which part is yours to shape, gives any card something to say.","example":{"from":"What will happen with my relationship?","to":"What do I want this relationship to feel like, and which part is mine to shape?"}},{"id":"is-it-going-to","pattern":"(?<=^\\s*|[.!?;:,(“\"—–]\\s*|\\b(?:and|but|or|so|then|also|honestly|really|tell\\s+me|i\\s+wonder)\\s+)(?:is|isn[’']t|are|aren[’']t)\\s+(?:it|this|that|things|everything|he|she|they|my\\s+\\w+|our\\s+\\w+|the\\s+\\w+)\\s+(?:ever\\s+|really\\s+|actually\\s+|still\\s+)?(?:going\\s+to|gonna)\\b(?!\\s+(?:the|a|an|my|your|his|her|their|our|school|bed|church|town|see)\\b|\\s+work\\b(?!\\s+out))","note":"This asks for a forecast, so most cards seem to miss. Ask what would help it go well and what is within your reach.","example":{"from":"Is it going to work out?","to":"What would help this go well, and what is within my reach this week?"}},{"id":"am-i-going-to","pattern":"(?<=^\\s*|[.!?;:,(“\"—–]\\s*|\\b(?:and|but|or|so|then|also|honestly|really|tell\\s+me|i\\s+wonder)\\s+)(?:am|aren[’']t)\\s+i\\s+(?:ever\\s+|really\\s+|actually\\s+|still\\s+)?(?:going\\s+to|gonna)\\b(?!\\s+(?:the|a|an|my|your|his|her|their|our|school|bed|church|town|see)\\b|\\s+work\\b(?!\\s+out))|(?<=^\\s*|[.!?;:,(“\"—–]\\s*|\\b(?:and|but|or|so|then|also|honestly|really|tell\\s+me|i\\s+wonder)\\s+)(?:are|aren[’']t)\\s+we\\s+(?:ever\\s+|really\\s+|actually\\s+|still\\s+)?(?:going\\s+to|gonna)\\b(?!\\s+(?:the|a|an|my|your|his|her|their|our|school|bed|church|town|see)\\b|\\s+work\\b(?!\\s+out))","note":"This asks the cards to foretell your part. Ask what would prepare you or make the next step easier, and any card can answer.","example":{"from":"Am I going to pass my exams?","to":"What one change would make my revision easier to begin tomorrow?"}},{"id":"will","pattern":"(?<!\\b(?:what|how|which|where|who|whom|whose|why)\\b[^.?!]*)\\b(?:will|won[’']t|shall)\\s+(?:i|we|he|she|they|it|this|that|there|things|everything|anything|someone|anyone|my|our|his|her|their|the)\\b|(?<!\\b(?:what|how|which|where|who|whom|whose|why)\\b[^.?!]*)\\b(?:if|whether)\\s+(?:i|we|he|she|they|it|this|that|things|everything|my\\s+\\w+|our\\s+\\w+)(?:\\s+will|\\s+won[’']t|[’']ll)\\b","note":"“Will…?” asks for a forecast, and most cards leave that unanswered. Ask what you can notice, shape or bring instead.","example":{"from":"Will I get the job?","to":"What am I underplaying about what I bring?"}},{"id":"should-i","gentle":true,"pattern":"(?<!\\b(?:what|how|which|where|who|whom|whose|why)\\b[^.?!]*)\\bshould\\s+(?:i|we)\\b|(?<!\\b(?:what|how|which|where|who|whom|whose|why)\\b[^.?!]*)\\b(?:whether|if)\\s+(?:or\\s+not\\s+)?(?:i|we)\\s+should\\b|(?<!\\b(?:what|how|which|where|who|whom|whose|why)\\b[^.?!]*)\\b(?:do|would)\\s+you\\s+(?:think|say|advise)\\s+(?:that\\s+)?(?:i|we)\\s+should\\b","note":"“Should I…?” quietly hands your choice to the cards. Asking what you need to understand before choosing keeps the decision with you.","example":{"from":"Should I leave?","to":"What do I need to understand before choosing whether to stay or go?"}},{"id":"meant-to-be","pattern":"\\b(?:am|are|is|was|were)\\s+(?:i|we|he|she|they|it|this|that|you)\\s+(?:really\\s+|truly\\s+)?(?:meant|destined|fated)\\s+(?:to|for)\\b|\\b(?:is|are|was|were)\\s+(?:he|she|they|this\\s+\\w+|my\\s+\\w+)\\s+(?:the\\s+one|my\\s+(?:soul\\s*mate|twin\\s+flame|person))\\b|\\bmeant\\s+to\\s+be\\s+(?:together|with)\\b|\\bsoul\\s*mates?\\b|\\btwin\\s+flames?\\b","note":"“Meant to be” and “the one” ask for a verdict. Ask what you want from closeness, and where you already see it.","example":{"from":"Are we meant to be together?","to":"What am I looking for in closeness, and where do I already see it?"}},{"id":"is-he-she-they","pattern":"(?<=^\\s*|[.!?;:,(“\"—–]\\s*|\\b(?:and|but|or|so|then|also|honestly|really|tell\\s+me|i\\s+wonder)\\s+)(?:is|isn[’']t|are|aren[’']t|was|wasn[’']t|were|weren[’']t|has|hasn[’']t|have|haven[’']t)\\s+(?:he|she|they|someone|somebody|(?:my|our)\\s+(?:ex|partner|boyfriend|girlfriend|husband|wife|spouse|fianc[eé]e?|crush|lover|date|boss|manager|colleague|co-?worker|friend|best\\s+friend|mother|father|mum|mom|dad|parents?|sister|brother|son|daughter|child|children|kids?|family|in-laws|teacher|client|landlord|neighbou?r|flatmate|roommate)|(?:this|that|the)\\s+(?:person|man|woman|guy|girl|boy))\\b","note":"This asks for a fact about someone else. Turn it towards what you can observe and what you would like to ask them directly.","example":{"from":"Is he serious about us?","to":"What would I like to ask directly about where we stand?"}},{"id":"does-do","pattern":"(?<=^\\s*|[.!?;:,(“\"—–]\\s*|\\b(?:and|but|or|so|then|also|honestly|really|tell\\s+me|i\\s+wonder)\\s+)(?:does|doesn[’']t|do|don[’']t|did|didn[’']t)\\s+(?:i|we|he|she|they|it|this|that|my|our|his|her|their|the|(?:he|she|they|someone|somebody|(?:my|our)\\s+(?:ex|partner|boyfriend|girlfriend|husband|wife|spouse|fianc[eé]e?|crush|lover|date|boss|manager|colleague|co-?worker|friend|best\\s+friend|mother|father|mum|mom|dad|parents?|sister|brother|son|daughter|child|children|kids?|family|in-laws|teacher|client|landlord|neighbou?r|flatmate|roommate)|(?:this|that|the)\\s+(?:person|man|woman|guy|girl|boy)))\\b|(?<!\\b(?:what|how|which|where|who|whom|whose|why)\\b[^.?!]*)\\b(?:do|does)\\s+(?:you|the\\s+cards?)\\s+(?:think|see|know|say|feel)\\b","note":"“Does…?” and “Do…?” invite a yes or no. Turning it into “What…” or “How…” about your own part lets any card answer.","example":{"from":"Does this job suit me?","to":"Which parts of this job feel like mine, and which feel borrowed?"}},{"id":"is-it","pattern":"(?<=^\\s*|[.!?;:,(“\"—–]\\s*|\\b(?:and|but|or|so|then|also|honestly|really|tell\\s+me|i\\s+wonder)\\s+)(?:is|isn[’']t|was|wasn[’']t|are|aren[’']t|were|weren[’']t)\\s+(?:it|this|that|there|these|those|now|today|the|my|our)\\b","note":"“Is it…?” asks the cards to confirm or deny. Ask which needs or values are involved, and every card has something to say.","example":{"from":"Is this the right decision?","to":"Which values does this decision serve, and which does it set aside?"}},{"id":"am-i","pattern":"(?<=^\\s*|[.!?;:,(“\"—–]\\s*|\\b(?:and|but|or|so|then|also|honestly|really|tell\\s+me|i\\s+wonder)\\s+)am\\s+i\\b|\\b(?:aren[’']t\\s+i|am\\s+i\\s+not)(?=\\s*\\?)","note":"“Am I…?” asks for a verdict on yourself. Ask what you notice, or what would help, and the reading has room to move.","example":{"from":"Am I making a mistake?","to":"What am I afraid of getting wrong, and how could I check it?"}},{"id":"can-could","pattern":"(?<=^\\s*|[.!?;:,(“\"—–]\\s*|\\b(?:and|but|or|so|then|also|honestly|really|tell\\s+me|i\\s+wonder)\\s+)(?:can|can[’']t|cannot|could|couldn[’']t|would|wouldn[’']t|might)\\s+(?:i|we|he|she|they|it|this|that|things|(?:he|she|they|someone|somebody|(?:my|our)\\s+(?:ex|partner|boyfriend|girlfriend|husband|wife|spouse|fianc[eé]e?|crush|lover|date|boss|manager|colleague|co-?worker|friend|best\\s+friend|mother|father|mum|mom|dad|parents?|sister|brother|son|daughter|child|children|kids?|family|in-laws|teacher|client|landlord|neighbou?r|flatmate|roommate)|(?:this|that|the)\\s+(?:person|man|woman|guy|girl|boy)))\\b","note":"“Can…?” and “Could…?” ask whether something is possible. Ask what would make it more possible, and any card can offer a step.","example":{"from":"Could this work?","to":"What would help this work, and what is within my reach this week?"}}],"thirdParty":[{"id":"what-they-think","pattern":"\\bwhat\\s+(?:does|do|did|is|are|was|were|will|would)\\s+(?:he|she|they|someone|somebody|(?:my|our)\\s+(?:ex|partner|boyfriend|girlfriend|husband|wife|spouse|fianc[eé]e?|crush|lover|date|boss|manager|colleague|co-?worker|friend|best\\s+friend|mother|father|mum|mom|dad|parents?|sister|brother|son|daughter|child|children|kids?|family|in-laws|teacher|client|landlord|neighbou?r|flatmate|roommate)|(?:this|that|the)\\s+(?:person|man|woman|guy|girl|boy))\\s+(?:really\\s+|secretly\\s+|honestly\\s+|actually\\s+|truly\\s+|still\\s+)?(?:think|thinking|feel|feeling|want|wanting|need|wish|mean|meant|plan|planning|intend|intending|expect|expecting|hide|hiding|see\\s+in\\s+me)\\b|\\bhow\\s+(?:does|do|did|is|are|will|would)\\s+(?:he|she|they|someone|somebody|(?:my|our)\\s+(?:ex|partner|boyfriend|girlfriend|husband|wife|spouse|fianc[eé]e?|crush|lover|date|boss|manager|colleague|co-?worker|friend|best\\s+friend|mother|father|mum|mom|dad|parents?|sister|brother|son|daughter|child|children|kids?|family|in-laws|teacher|client|landlord|neighbou?r|flatmate|roommate)|(?:this|that|the)\\s+(?:person|man|woman|guy|girl|boy))\\s+(?:really\\s+|secretly\\s+|honestly\\s+|actually\\s+|truly\\s+|still\\s+)?(?:feel|feeling|see|think\\s+(?:of|about))\\b|\\bwhat[’']s\\s+(?:(?:going\\s+)?on\\s+(?:in\\s+)?(?:his|her|their)\\s+(?:mind|head)|(?:he|she)\\s+(?:thinking|feeling|planning|hiding))\\b|\\bwhat\\s+(?:does|did)\\s+(?!(?:i|we|you|it|this|that|life|work|death|justice|strength|temperance|judgement|judgment|tower|star|moon|sun|world|fool|magician|lovers|chariot|hermit|devil|empress|emperor|hierophant)\\b)[a-z][\\w’'-]*\\s+(?:really\\s+|secretly\\s+|honestly\\s+|actually\\s+|truly\\s+|still\\s+)?(?:think|feel|want|need|mean)\\s+(?:of|about|for|towards|toward|from|with)\\s+me\\b","note":"No reading can see inside someone else’s mind. Ask what you notice, what you feel, and what you would like to ask them.","example":{"from":"What does he think of me?","to":"What do I notice, what do I feel, and what would I like to ask directly?"}},{"id":"loves-me","pattern":"\\b(?:does|do|did|doesn[’']t|don[’']t|didn[’']t|will|would|could)\\s+(?!(?:i|we|you|it|this|that|things|everything|anything|life|work|help|make|let|death|justice|strength|temperance|judgement|judgment|tower|star|moon|sun|world|fool|magician|lovers|chariot|hermit|devil|empress|emperor|hierophant|the\\s+(?:cards?|reading|spread|death|justice|strength|temperance|judgement|judgment|tower|star|moon|sun|world|fool|magician|lovers|chariot|hermit|devil|empress|emperor|hierophant))\\b)[a-z][\\w’'-]*(?:\\s+(?!me\\b|you\\b|us\\b)[a-z][\\w’'-]*)?\\s+(?:really\\s+|secretly\\s+|honestly\\s+|actually\\s+|truly\\s+|still\\s+)?(?:love|like|miss|want|fancy|care\\s+(?:about|for)|think\\s+(?:about|of)|hate|trust|need|respect|notice|remember|forgive|choose|see)\\s+me\\b|\\b(?:is|are)\\s+(?:he|she|they|someone|somebody|(?:my|our)\\s+(?:ex|partner|boyfriend|girlfriend|husband|wife|spouse|fianc[eé]e?|crush|lover|date|boss|manager|colleague|co-?worker|friend|best\\s+friend|mother|father|mum|mom|dad|parents?|sister|brother|son|daughter|child|children|kids?|family|in-laws|teacher|client|landlord|neighbou?r|flatmate|roommate)|(?:this|that|the)\\s+(?:person|man|woman|guy|girl|boy))\\s+(?:really\\s+|secretly\\s+|honestly\\s+|actually\\s+|truly\\s+|still\\s+)?(?:in\\s+love\\s+with|into|attracted\\s+to|thinking\\s+(?:of|about)|over|missing|jealous\\s+of|angry\\s+with|mad\\s+at)\\s+me\\b","note":"Another person’s feelings are theirs to share. Ask what you want this bond to feel like, and which part is yours to shape.","example":{"from":"Does she love me?","to":"What do I want this relationship to feel like, and which part is mine to shape?"}},{"id":"come-back","pattern":"\\b(?:will|would|could|is|are|does|do)\\s+(?!(?:i|we|you|it|this|that|things|everything|anything|life|work|help|make|let|death|justice|strength|temperance|judgement|judgment|tower|star|moon|sun|world|fool|magician|lovers|chariot|hermit|devil|empress|emperor|hierophant|the\\s+(?:cards?|reading|spread|death|justice|strength|temperance|judgement|judgment|tower|star|moon|sun|world|fool|magician|lovers|chariot|hermit|devil|empress|emperor|hierophant))\\b)[a-z][\\w’'-]*(?:\\s+(?!me\\b|you\\b|us\\b)[a-z][\\w’'-]*)?\\s+(?:ever\\s+|still\\s+|really\\s+|going\\s+to\\s+|gonna\\s+)*(?:come\\s+back|coming\\s+back|return|returning|reach\\s+out|text|call|message|write|contact\\s+me|apologi[sz]e|leave\\s+(?:him|her|them|his|their)|get\\s+back\\s+(?:together|with\\s+me))\\b|\\b(?:get|getting|be|come|coming)\\s+back\\s+together\\b","note":"Someone else’s next move is theirs to make. Ask what you need now, and what you would like to say if they reach out.","example":{"from":"Will they come back?","to":"What do I need right now, whatever they choose?"}},{"id":"hiding","pattern":"\\b(?:is|are|was|were|has|have|isn[’']t|aren[’']t)\\s+(?!i\\b|we\\b|you\\b|it\\b)(?:[a-z][\\w’'-]*\\s+){1,2}?(?:been\\s+)?(?:hiding|cheating|lying|seeing\\s+some(?:one|body)(?:\\s+else)?|having\\s+an\\s+affair|unfaithful|two-timing|using\\s+me|playing\\s+me|honest\\s+with\\s+me|faithful)\\b|\\bwhat[’']s\\s+(?:he|she|they)\\s+hiding\\b|\\b(?:he|she|they)(?:\\s+is|\\s+are|[’']s|[’']re)\\s+(?:secretly\\s+)?(?:cheating|lying|hiding)\\b","note":"The cards can’t reveal what someone keeps private. Ask what you know, what you feel, and what you would like to ask directly.","example":{"from":"What is he hiding?","to":"What do I know, what do I feel, and what would I like to ask directly?"}},{"id":"their-feelings","pattern":"\\b(?:his|her|their)\\s+(?:true\\s+|real\\s+|hidden\\s+|secret\\s+)?(?:feelings|intentions|motives|thoughts|plans)\\s+(?:for|towards|toward|about|with)\\s+(?:me|us)\\b|\\bwhat\\s+(?:are|were)\\s+(?:his|her|their)\\s+(?:true\\s+|real\\s+)?(?:feelings|intentions|motives)\\b|\\bhow\\s+(?:he|she|they|someone|somebody|(?:my|our)\\s+(?:ex|partner|boyfriend|girlfriend|husband|wife|spouse|fianc[eé]e?|crush|lover|date|boss|manager|colleague|co-?worker|friend|best\\s+friend|mother|father|mum|mom|dad|parents?|sister|brother|son|daughter|child|children|kids?|family|in-laws|teacher|client|landlord|neighbou?r|flatmate|roommate)|(?:this|that|the)\\s+(?:person|man|woman|guy|girl|boy))\\s+(?:really\\s+|secretly\\s+|honestly\\s+|actually\\s+|truly\\s+|still\\s+)?(?:feels?|sees?|thinks?)\\s+(?:about|of)\\s+(?:me|us)\\b|\\bread\\s+(?:his|her|their)\\s+(?:mind|heart|energy|feelings|intentions)\\b|\\b(?:his|her|their)\\s+energy\\s+(?:towards?|for|around)\\s+me\\b","note":"Olivia never claims to know another person’s feelings or motives. Ask about your side: what you observe, want and could say.","example":{"from":"I want to know how she feels about me.","to":"What would I like to say about how I feel?"}}],"sensitive":[{"id":"self-harm","support":true,"pattern":"\\b(?:suicid(?:e|al|es)|kill(?:ing)?\\s+my\\s*self|end(?:ing)?\\s+(?:my\\s+(?:own\\s+)?life|it\\s+all)|take\\s+my\\s+(?:own\\s+)?life|(?:want|wanted|wanna)\\s+(?:to\\s+)?die|wish\\s+(?:that\\s+)?i\\s+(?:was|were)\\s+dead|better\\s+off\\s+(?:dead|without\\s+me)|(?:don[’']t|do\\s+not)\\s+want\\s+to\\s+(?:live|be\\s+alive|exist|be\\s+here|wake\\s+up)|no\\s+reason\\s+to\\s+(?:live|go\\s+on)|self[-\\s]?harm(?:ing)?|(?:hurt|hurting|harm|harming)\\s+my\\s*self|cut(?:ting)?\\s+my\\s*self(?!\\s+off)|overdos(?:e|ed|ing)|not\\s+be\\s+here\\s+anymore)\\b","note":"You matter more than any reading. Olivia pauses here and shows support lines you can reach now. If you are in immediate danger, call your local emergency number."},{"id":"safety","support":true,"pattern":"\\b(?:abus(?:e|es|ed|ive|ing|er)|(?:he|she|they|partner|husband|wife|boyfriend|girlfriend|dad|father|mum|mom|mother|parent|ex)\\s+(?:hits?|beats?|hurts?|chokes?|kicks?|slaps?|push(?:es)?|shoves?|threatens?)\\s+me|threaten(?:s|ed|ing)?\\s+(?:me|to\\s+(?:hurt|kill|take))|stalk(?:s|ed|ing|er|ers)?|violen(?:t|ce)|(?:i\\s+am|i[’']m|i\\s+feel|we\\s+are|we[’']re)\\s+(?:not\\s+safe|unsafe|in\\s+danger)|(?:am\\s+i|are\\s+we|my\\s+(?:life|kids?|children)\\s+(?:is|are))\\s+in\\s+danger|not\\s+safe\\s+(?:at\\s+home|with\\s+(?:him|her|them))|(?:scared|afraid|frightened|terrified)\\s+(?:of\\s+(?:him|her|them)(?=\\s*[.?!,…]|\\s*$)|for\\s+my\\s+(?:life|safety))|coercive|controlling\\s+(?:partner|husband|wife|boyfriend|girlfriend|relationship)|rape[ds]?|(?:sexual(?:ly)?\\s+)?assault(?:ed)?)\\b","note":"Your safety comes first. Olivia shows support contacts you can reach now. If you are in immediate danger, please call your local emergency number."},{"id":"health","pattern":"\\b(?:ill(?:ness|nesses)?|sick(?:ness)?(?!\\s+(?:of|and\\s+tired))|disease|diagnos(?:is|es|ed|e)